The earlier brace-expansion acceptance no longer applies: 1.1.18 and 2.1.4 now
exist, so the fix no longer requires the incompatible v5 line. Overrides are
keyed per major (`brace-expansion@1`) to avoid forcing one major onto both
dependency paths.

